<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on DAX index.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on DAX index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products set a total of 1.5 million European-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on the DAX index, lead manager BfG Bank AG said.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   28.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	11.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT		 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  2994.53 DEM</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT		ISSUE PRICE</p>
<p> MODERATE BULLISH   6.29 DEM</p>
<p> BULLISH		4.96 DEM</p>
<p> SIDEWARDS	    6.61 DEM</p>
<p> NOTES	     PAYMENT IS LINKED TO THE NUMBER OF BUSINESS</p>
<p>		     DAYS THAT THE DAX INDEX CLOSES WITHIN THE</p>
<p>		     RELEVANT RANGES DURING EACH CALCUALTION PERIOD</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
